> 
> Create → Update

<a id="27deda9b0fe18107a214df21ccc4a0a7"></a>

### 1&#46; Partial Type

<a id="27deda9b0fe18115b963da024fd36d2d"></a>

```typescript
export class CreateMoviceDto {
		@IsNotEmpty()
		@IsString()
		title: string;

		@IsNotEmpty()
		@IsString()
		detail: string;

		@IsNotEmpty()
		@IsString()
		derectorId: number;

		@IsNotEmpty()
		@ArrayNotEmpty()
		@IsNumber({}, {
				each: true,
		})
		genreIds: number[];
}
```

<details>
<summary>적용 전</summary>

<a id="27deda9b0fe18061a66cff3e6fe8f341"></a>

```typescript
export class UpdateMoviceDto {
		@IsNotEmpty()
		@IsString()
		@IsOptional()
		title: string;

		@IsNotEmpty()
		@IsString()
		@IsOptional()
		detail: string;

		@IsNotEmpty()
		@IsString()
		@IsOptional()
		derectorId: number;

		@IsNotEmpty()
		@ArrayNotEmpty()
		@IsNumber({}, {
				each: true,
		})
		@IsOptional()
		genreIds: number[];
}
```

</details>

<a id="27deda9b0fe18062942ee629fe421e09"></a>

```typescript
export class UpdateMoviceDto 
  extends PartialType(
		  CreateMoviceDto
	) {}
```

- <code>Optional</code>이 적용된 프로퍼티(필드)들을 생성

- 나머지 내용도 방식은 동일하므로 생략
